Aim: Demonstrate multilevel inheritance.

Algorithm: Start
create three-level classes
call inherited methods
stop.

Program:

class A { void one(){System.out.println("A");} }
class B extends A { void two(){System.out.println("B");} }
class C extends B { void three(){System.out.println("C");} }
class Multilevel {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        C obj=new C(); obj.one(); obj.two(); obj.three();
    }
}

Result: A, B and C are displayed
